  unitName: Meltia
  unitId: 20094
  unitNumber: 365
  description: A high-ranked spirit that rules over all water. Even in places with
    small amounts of water, she moves freely through the air. It's said that when
    a rainbow filled the sky she would appear dancing above. It's thought that anyone
    who sees her is lucky, and many have reached toward the skies trying to catch
    her. She doesn't like this, however, and should anyone try to touch her she encases
    everything in water with a cold look on her face.
  summonDesc: Won't you dance with me?<br>Why, you ask? He he he.<br>Won't know 'til
    you try!
  fusionDesc: Huh? What could this be?<br>Oh, I see. You're a bad seed,<br>aren't
    you?
  evoDesc: You can actually see me?<br>He he he. Well then, why <br>don't you come
    a little closer?
